Package: virtiofs-notify-host
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: local <root@localhost>
Depends: python3
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: send host-side changes on virtiofs shares to Proxmox VMs
 Watches the filesystems behind the virtiofs shares of every VM with a vsock device
 (args: -device vhost-vsock-pci,guest-cid=N) using fanotify, and sends each change the
 VM did not make itself to virtiofs-notify-guest in that VM.
